[gd_scene load_steps=19 format=3]

; zone_drowned_mire — the drowned village (act 2, map two; A2-01, 2026-10-02), band 31–35.
;
; The stone gives way to black water and reeds. A causeway crosses the marsh from the south-west
; corner to the north-east. Crawlers come out of the shallows by the way in, the drowned still walk
; the streets of their village, serpents keep the reed beds, spitters the graveyard, the witches and
; the brutes the sunken chapel. The Drowned King sits in what is left of his hall in the south-east,
; walls on three sides, behind his guard.
;
; Everything the player walks on or into is a kit piece naming an id; woods and clutter are
; ScatterNodes, seeded. Every creature is tuning in game/data/zones/act2.json. This file is
; coordinates. Written by `kiln scenes` from src/Kiln.Tools/Commands/Act2Layouts.cs: change the
; layout, not this file.

